{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prison Escape Simulator is a single-player Escape and Survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, Kill, Hide, Find the Right Path and Escape from the Island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story of the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The prisoner will be executed. His only remedy is to escape from prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is in your hands. Survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to save the prisoner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The survival-themed escape game will take your breath away.\u00a0Experience an action adventure with limitless play. Explore the mysterious island. And find your escape route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the joy of descending the mountain, immerse yourself in the flow of the story and fight and survive with different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/20250210_170945.jpg?t=1742596716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507120?t=1742596716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/61ae08f78ede7ac022cba26ea60d2347359f5999/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742596716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/932e91813adb85e16ab7761f3980d458cf7d4cb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742596716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/932e91813adb85e16ab7761f3980d458cf7d4cb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742596716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prison Escape Simulator is a single-player Escape and Survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, Kill, Hide, Find the Right Path and Escape from the Island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story of the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The prisoner will be executed. His only remedy is to escape from prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is in your hands. Survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to save the prisoner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The survival-themed escape game will take your breath away.\u00a0Experience an action adventure with limitless play. Explore the mysterious island. And find your escape route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the joy of descending the mountain, immerse yourself in the flow of the story and fight and survive with different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/20250210_170945.jpg?t=1742596716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Pegax Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/64fca624d459388082ffc0931c22bcf31717acb7/header.jpg?t=1742596716","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights of the game belong to Pegax games.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257110543,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110543/movie480.mp4?t=1742308698","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110543/movie_max.mp4?t=1742308698"},"name":"Prison Escape Simulator","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257110543/daaea808c4dd149574ed0390024cc28e2787ef8e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742308698","